§§ `Overissue, evidence and delivery obligations (ss 52 to 54)`

-- What may I do if validating or issuing my security would be an overissue (s 52(1))?
#ASSERT `What may I do if validating or issuing my security would be an overissue` FALSE TRUE 100 EQUALS `the provisions of this Part apply, because there would be no overissue`
#ASSERT `What may I do if validating or issuing my security would be an overissue` TRUE FALSE 100 EQUALS (`the person may recover from the issuer the price the last purchaser for value paid for the invalid security` WITH `the amount in dollars` IS 100)
#ASSERT `What may I do if validating or issuing my security would be an overissue` TRUE TRUE 100 EQUALS `the person may compel the issuer to purchase and deliver a similar valid security against surrender of the security held`

