#ASSERT `May the appointee carry on the business of the corporation` `a receiver appointed in respect of property of a corporation` TRUE EQUALS (JUST TRUE)
#ASSERT `May the appointee carry on the business of the corporation` `a sequestrator of property of a corporation` FALSE EQUALS (JUST FALSE)
#ASSERT `May the appointee carry on the business of the corporation` `a receiver-manager of a corporation` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

